---
import Basic from "../../layouts/Basic.astro";
---
<Basic title="Desmos" description="My Desmos creations :3">
    <h1 id="dessieowo" class="mainHeader">My Desmos Creations :3</h1>
    <section>
        <h2 id="desmosynth">Desmosynth</h2>
        <p>Desmosynth is a music player in Desmos with multi-track support, preprogrammed notes, smooth note transitions, decay, and more. Desmosynth was made by my friend Alex D. and I.</p>
        <span>Never Gonna Give You Up V2: <a href="https://www.desmos.com/calculator/8orckhsgww" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">https://www.desmos.com/calculator/8orckhsgww</a></span><br>
        <span>Crab Rave V2: <a href="https://www.desmos.com/calculator/gkzoc0glqd" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">https://www.desmos.com/calculator/gkzoc0glqd</a></span>
        <p>V1 lacks smooth note transitions and decay, but has more visual effects. V1 may have an inaccurate tempo on some devices.</p>
        <span>Never Gonna Give You Up V1: <a href="https://www.desmos.com/calculator/gixrljpelh" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">https://www.desmos.com/calculator/gixrljpelh</a></span>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h2 id="hsv">HSV Color Picker</h2>
        <p>HSV Color Picker is a graphical color picker with hue, saturation, and vibrance controls.</p>
        <span>&gt;&gt; <a href="https://www.desmos.com/calculator/fdksyxdjsc" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">https://www.desmos.com/calculator/fdksyxdjsc</a></span>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h2 id="pin">Pin Keypad</h2>
        <p>Pin Keypad is a simple little keypad that opens when you enter the correct code.</p>
        <span>&gt;&gt; <a href="https://www.desmos.com/calculator/2exr3zsj5n" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">https://www.desmos.com/calculator/2exr3zsj5n</a></span>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h2 id="3d">3D Graph Tool</h2>
        <p>3D Graph Tool graphs points of a figure in a 3D space.</p>
        <span>&gt;&gt; <a href="https://www.desmos.com/calculator/6amfard0k1" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">https://www.desmos.com/calculator/6amfard0k1</a></span>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h2 id="16">16x16 Animated Binary Display</h2>
        <p>A 16x16 animated binary display. I could probably make this better today using point lists, but this gets the job done. I may remake it someday to add color and get rid of the ugly polygon nonsense but we'll see.</p>
        <span>&gt;&gt; <a href="https://www.desmos.com/calculator/lbpqlkf2rb" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">https://www.desmos.com/calculator/lbpqlkf2rb</a></span>
    </section>
</Basic>